.Dd November 20, 2026
.Dt DER32-INSTALL 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm der32-install
.Nd install DER/32 onto a disk
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl f Ar answer-file
.Op Fl s Ar sets-dir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
installs DER/32 from a booted install medium, the live ISO or the USB
installer image, onto a disk.
It asks a few questions, then:
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
replaces the disk's partition table with a GPT holding a 256\ MiB EFI
system partition
.Pq Li der32efi ,
optional swap
.Pq Li der32swap
and an FFSv2 root using the rest of the disk
.Pq Li der32root ;
.It
extracts the release sets
.Pq base, etc, comp, man, misc, text, kern-DER32 ;
.It
installs both the BIOS boot loader (GPT boot code plus
.Pa /usr/mdec/bootxx_ffsv2 )
and the UEFI loader
.Pa EFI/BOOT/BOOTX64.EFI ,
so the disk boots either way;
.It
writes
.Pa /etc/fstab
(by GPT label),
.Pa /etc/rc.conf ,
.Pa /boot.cfg
and the time zone, sets root's password and optionally creates a user in
group
.Li wheel ;
.It
optionally installs the X11 sets and the XFCE desktop from NetBSD's
binary packages with
.Xr pkgin 1 .
This needs a working network connection.
.El
.Pp
Nothing is written to any disk until the disk is confirmed by typing
.Dq Li erase Ar disk .
The disk the installer itself booted from is never offered.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl f Ar answer-file
Run without questions.
The file is read by
.Xr sh 1
and sets the variables below.
.It Fl s Ar sets-dir
Take the sets from
.Ar sets-dir
instead of
.Pa /der32/sets .
.El
.Sh ANSWER FILE
.Bl -tag -width USER_PWHASH -compact
.It Ev DISK
target disk, for example
.Li wd0
.It Ev CONFIRM
must be
.Dq Li erase Ev $DISK
.It Ev HOSTNAME
default
.Li der32
.It Ev TIMEZONE
a name under
.Pa /usr/share/zoneinfo ,
default
.Li UTC
.It Ev CONSOLE
.Li screen
or
.Li serial
.It Ev SWAP_MB
swap size, 0 for none
.It Ev ROOT_PWHASH
root's password hash, from
.Xr pwhash 1
(required)
.It Ev USERNAME
optional user to create
.It Ev USER_PWHASH
that user's password hash
.It Ev DHCP , XFCE
.Li yes
or
.Li no
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /var/log/der32-install.log -compact
.It Pa /der32/sets
release sets on the install medium
.It Pa /tmp/der32-install.log
log of the run, copied to
.Pa /var/log/der32-install.log
on the new system
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
# der32-install
.Ed
.Pp
Unattended:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
DISK=wd0
CONFIRM="erase wd0"
HOSTNAME=tortoise
TIMEZONE=America/Boise
CONSOLE=screen
SWAP_MB=1024
ROOT_PWHASH='$argon2id$v=19$...'
DHCP=yes XFCE=no
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pkgin 1 ,
.Xr pwhash 1 ,
.Xr upkg 8 ,
.Xr boot 8 ,
.Xr gpt 8 ,
.Xr installboot 8
.Sh HISTORY
.Nm
first appeared in DER/32 0.1
.Dq Genesis .
.Sh BUGS
The SSH server is not offered: in DER/32 0.1, loading SSH private keys
hangs, so an enabled
.Xr sshd 8
would stop the boot.
.Sh CAVEATS
The XFCE option downloads several hundred megabytes from
.Li cdn.NetBSD.org .
If that fails, the X11 sets are still installed and the desktop can be
added later with
.Ic pkgin install xfce4 .
